  { question: 'What is the difference between shoulder mobility and stretching?', answer: 'Stretching usually targets range or sensation in a position. Mobility also includes active control through that range. Lifters often benefit from combining gentle range work with controlled movement and strength.' },
  { question: 'Should I do shoulder mobility before bench press?', answer: 'A short warmup that includes upper-back movement, shoulder rotation and gradually heavier pressing can be useful before benching. Avoid aggressive stretching that leaves the shoulder feeling unstable or irritated.' },
